<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-11T14:28:49.060Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:28:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed thugs continue to assault NDC supporters at Enugu airport while suspected herders carry out lethal raids on Benue communities, killing civilians. Gunmen have also targeted miners at Plateau mining sites, resulting in multiple deaths. The military suffered a major aircraft crash that killed dozens, adding a new dimension of military loss to the violence. Police arrested seventeen suspected human traffickers and rescued an abducted boy in a 24‑hour operation. The conflict caused 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPd1h3bjVIUXJoS0h5VDY3WU9BLURaQUVwZVgzUjN6V2dKaWg5MTVFUTRxMDM1Y2VjaTZLOXk5ZUpkcW1tQVJFb2JLakRzc2hDQUp6Z0RwS2liUEZGSC1oLTZOdkRHX1ZRWlpvVTRzYlBGUHlpWlJhbDFQSk8wdTZnVzhIc0RFYTF1YjBXTVdsaTlSV0RSeGhtd0padHBPTFcyRmZMLUtjU3E3NWRfUDBKNw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE1nSm1UUTNSLVU0X01QM1VzbTZrWEFndktfa2hza3N1MHFESlp1dnltck9VZ3lFNnlUNERUYXF5RVNiUzB5NVVadXdFUDNQOU5vdWUyTmZhb0FsVmVreHowaldHSFBVN1Ryb2dPOUR1Z21Rc2dQWFNSNmtnS18?oc=5&quot;&gt;NigerianEye&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOdXZNUDNVdTY0Q2FibWV2NjVaRWF3dEhxN3lJbWo5TTdvdmZQVGhFZDlLZjY2VTZpSmlraFNUYWNUVVIwUURfVUh3OWY0ZnVrNDJtbWJ4alJGYWV0cWhsOXFzWHI0Wk5CblR1b2hERDhDcUNSRUJNRFg3bGlnNmdKX1FqRW9maU9Ya282c3RMQmpTYUJG?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxORFBybEFBOXdmZUhPR0x4dng1aFFpVE12S0syczYxXzdYWjgwX1pyZFNwVHUzcEJWVm1xUF9WRVlDLVFYT1Vab05XY3dSZTFtc0gzUG1sZDVoTHpqeXVBYWRnc2N6OE0xcW1BUFk4VEUzVDJfNk5DRU1UdXdMaHNCeE9QZWxUblFRSjQ2eWJRNm5zNE1NR2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTFBwNVJDX0xHN09yXzJfYm